<title>POLAND: PBR group 96 net rises to PLN 20.4 mln.</title>
<headline>PBR group 96 net rises to PLN 20.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PBR group results for the</p>
<p>financial year ending December 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	   1995</p>
<p>    group operating profit		45.17    vs  35.58</p>
<p>    group pre-tax profit		  45.19    vs  35.68</p>
<p>    group net profit			20.39    vs  14.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Polski Bank Rozwoju SA.</p>
<p>    group revenues from securities	  0.16    vs   0.04</p>
<p>    group interest and similar revenues 188.34    vs 159.46</p>
<p>    group interest and similar costs    124.20    vs  94.07</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    group revenues from commission	 11.38    vs  11.28</p>
<p>    group costs of commission		 3.22    vs   2.91</p>
<p>    group income tax			   24.80    vs  21.68</p>
<p>    group other taxes			   0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    group extraordinary profit		0.10    vs   0.02</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
